#!/bin/bash
# side-inbox — save whatever you copied into a local inbox folder (~/inbox),
# so output from read-only AI windows (Claude Code side chat, Codex /side,
# ChatGPT web, ...) is kept on disk without passing through your main agent.
#
# Usage:
#   side-inbox quick                     For a hotkey: save clipboard now, show a notification
#   side-inbox stage                     Save clipboard to a staging file and print a preview
#   side-inbox commit <staged> [title]   Move a staged file into the inbox
#   side-inbox discard <staged>          Drop a staged file
#   side-inbox list                      List items waiting in the inbox
#   side-inbox merged <name> <dest>      Record that an item was filed (used by the merge skill)
#   side-inbox path                      Print the inbox directory
#
# Env: SIDE_INBOX_DIR overrides the inbox location (default ~/inbox).
set -euo pipefail
export LANG=en_US.UTF-8 LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8

INBOX="${SIDE_INBOX_DIR:-$HOME/inbox}"
STAGING="$INBOX/.staging"
LOG="$INBOX/.log"
SELF="$(cd "$(dirname "$0")" && pwd)/$(basename "$0")"

# Messages follow the macOS UI language (Chinese or English).
if defaults read -g AppleLanguages 2>/dev/null | grep -q '"zh'; then ZH=1; else ZH=0; fi
msg() { if [ "$ZH" = 1 ]; then printf '%s' "$2"; else printf '%s' "$1"; fi; }

notify() {
  local t=${1//\"/\\\"} b=${2//\"/\\\"}
  osascript -e "display notification \"$b\" with title \"$t\"" >/dev/null 2>&1 || true
}

# File-name-safe title, max 40 characters (not bytes).
sanitize_title() {
  printf '%s' "$1" | tr -d '\r' \
    | sed -E 's#[/:*?"<>|\\]+# #g' \
    | perl -CS -pe 's/^\s+|\s+$//g; s/^(.{40}).*/$1/'
}

cmd="${1:-}"
case "$cmd" in
stage)
  mkdir -p "$STAGING"
  ts=$(date +%Y-%m-%d-%H%M%S)
  tmp="$STAGING/$ts.md"
  pbpaste > "$tmp" 2>/dev/null || true
  if [ ! -s "$tmp" ]; then
    rm -f "$tmp"
    msg "Clipboard is empty or not text." "剪贴板为空，或内容不是文本（比如图片）。" >&2; echo >&2
    exit 1
  fi
  if [ -n "$(tail -c1 "$tmp")" ]; then echo >> "$tmp"; fi
  lines=$(wc -l < "$tmp" | tr -d ' ')
  chars=$(wc -m < "$tmp" | tr -d ' ')
  title=$(grep -m1 -E '^#{1,6} ' "$tmp" | sed -E 's/^#{1,6} +//' || true)
  [ -n "$title" ] || title=$(grep -m1 -vE '^[[:space:]]*$' "$tmp" || true)
  title=$(sanitize_title "$title")
  echo "STAGED=$tmp"
  echo "LINES=$lines"
  echo "CHARS=$chars"
  echo "TITLE=$title"
  echo "--- first 5 lines ---"; head -5 "$tmp"
  echo "--- last 2 lines ---";  tail -2 "$tmp"
  ;;
commit)
  staged="${2:?missing staged file path}"
  title="${3:-}"
  [ -f "$staged" ] || { echo "staged file not found: $staged" >&2; exit 1; }
  base=$(basename "$staged" .md)
  [ -n "$title" ] || title="untitled"
  dest="$INBOX/${base}-$(sanitize_title "$title").md"
  mv "$staged" "$dest"
  lines=$(wc -l < "$dest" | tr -d ' ')
  printf '%s\tsaved\t%s\t%s lines\tsource=clipboard\n' "$(date '+%F %T')" "$(basename "$dest")" "$lines" >> "$LOG"
  echo "SAVED=$dest"
  echo "LINES=$lines"
  ;;
discard)
  rm -f "${2:?missing staged file path}"
  msg "Discarded." "已丢弃。"; echo
  ;;
list)
  shopt -s nullglob
  files=("$INBOX"/*.md)
  if [ ${#files[@]} -eq 0 ]; then msg "Inbox is empty." "收件箱是空的。"; echo; exit 0; fi
  i=0
  for f in "${files[@]}"; do
    i=$((i+1))
    l=$(wc -l < "$f" | tr -d ' ')
    first=$(grep -m1 -vE '^[[:space:]]*$' "$f" | perl -CS -pe 's/^(.{60}).*/$1/' || true)
    printf '%d) %s  (%s lines)  %s\n' "$i" "$(basename "$f")" "$l" "$first"
  done
  ;;
merged)
  name="${2:?missing file name}"; dest="${3:?missing destination}"
  mkdir -p "$INBOX"
  printf '%s\tmerged\t%s\t-> %s\n' "$(date '+%F %T')" "$name" "$dest" >> "$LOG"
  msg "Logged." "已记录。"; echo
  ;;
path)
  echo "$INBOX"
  ;;
quick)
  # No questions asked. Two guards against saving the wrong thing:
  #  1. macOS bumps a clipboard change counter on every copy; if it has not
  #     moved since the last save, nothing new was copied -> skip.
  #  2. If identical content is already in the inbox -> skip.
  mkdir -p "$INBOX"
  cc=$(osascript -l JavaScript -e 'ObjC.import("AppKit"); $.NSPasteboard.generalPasteboard.changeCount' 2>/dev/null || echo "")
  last=$(cat "$INBOX/.last_clip" 2>/dev/null || echo "")
  if [ -n "$cc" ] && [ "$cc" = "$last" ]; then
    notify "$(msg 'Inbox: not saved' '收件箱：没存')" "$(msg 'Nothing new was copied since the last save' '剪贴板自上次存过后没有新复制的内容')"
    exit 0
  fi
  out=$("$SELF" stage 2>/dev/null) || { notify "$(msg 'Inbox: not saved' '收件箱：没存')" "$(msg 'Clipboard is empty or not text' '剪贴板为空，或不是文字')"; exit 0; }
  staged=$(printf '%s\n' "$out" | sed -n 's/^STAGED=//p')
  title=$(printf '%s\n' "$out" | sed -n 's/^TITLE=//p')
  lines=$(printf '%s\n' "$out" | sed -n 's/^LINES=//p')
  shopt -s nullglob
  for f in "$INBOX"/*.md; do
    if cmp -s "$staged" "$f"; then
      rm -f "$staged"
      [ -n "$cc" ] && printf '%s' "$cc" > "$INBOX/.last_clip"
      notify "$(msg 'Inbox: not saved' '收件箱：没存')" "$(msg 'Already saved as' '这段已经存过了：') $(basename "$f")"
      exit 0
    fi
  done
  "$SELF" commit "$staged" "$title" >/dev/null
  [ -n "$cc" ] && printf '%s' "$cc" > "$INBOX/.last_clip"
  hint=""
  if [ "${lines:-0}" -lt 3 ]; then hint=" · $(msg 'very short — copied the right thing?' '很短，确认是不是复制错了')"; fi
  notify "$(msg "Inbox: saved $lines lines" "收件箱：已存 $lines 行")" "${title}${hint}"
  ;;
*)
  echo "usage: side-inbox quick | stage | commit <staged> [title] | discard <staged> | list | merged <name> <dest> | path" >&2
  exit 2
  ;;
esac
